Exercises — 02 Node.js Architecture
Do these after reading the topic README and running node examples/architecture.js.
No solutions are provided on purpose — the exercise is the learning.
If you are stuck, re-read Section 4 of the README and run the example again.

Exercise 1 — Draw It Yourself ⭐ Start here
Redraw Diagram 1 (the layers diagram) from memory, without looking at the README.
Label these five parts, in order from top to bottom:
Your Application
Node.js Standard Library
Node.js Bindings
